__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.DS_Store
.superpowers/
# Build output. build.sh deletes and recreates the whole bundle, and it carries
# a copy of procwatch.py inside it -- committed, that copy drifts from the real
# one and the next reader cannot tell which is authoritative. The old 1.0.0 name
# is kept because an existing checkout may still have one.
menubar/Procwatch.app/
menubar/ProcwatchBar.app/

# Screenshots and the icon belong in the repository -- the landing page needs
# them -- but not the Finder's droppings inside those folders.
!docs/images/
docs/**/.DS_Store
